# ---- Moon Phase Influence ----
option.MOON_PHASE_INFLUENCE_INTENSITY=Moon Phase Influence
option.MOON_PHASE_INFLUENCE_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts how strongly the current moon phase affects all moon-phased effects below. 0 = no effect, 1 = full effect.
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE = Moon-Phased Night Atmosphere
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE.comment = When enabled, fog and sky atmosphere at night vary with the lunar cycle.
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE_INTENSITY=Night Fog Intensity
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects atmospheric fog brightness at night.
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE_CONTRAST=Night Fog Contrast
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE_CONTRAST.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects atmospheric contrast at night.
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE_SATURATION=Night Fog Saturation
option.MOON_PHASE_NIGHT_ATMOSPHERE_SATURATION.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects atmospheric color saturation at night.
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS = Moon-Phased Reflections
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS.comment = When enabled, the brightness and color of reflections vary with the lunar cycle.
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_INTENSITY=Reflection Brightness
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects reflection brightness at night.
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_CONTRAST=Reflection Contrast
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_CONTRAST.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects reflection contrast at night.
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_SATURATION=Reflection Saturation
option.MOON_PHASE_REFLECTIONS_SATURATION.comment = Adjusts how strongly the moon phase affects reflection color saturation at night.



option.SH_SKYLIGHT=SH Skylight
option.SH_SKYLIGHT.comment=Adds natural sky lighting to surfaces not directly in sunlight. Brightens shaded sides and interiors with soft sky-colored light using a compact H-Basis projection of the live sky map. The contribution updates live with time of day and weather, and uses the bent normal plus AO-driven cone-narrowing so corners and crevices pick up the correct average visible sky direction. Far cheaper than per-fragment hemisphere sampling — enabled by default on High/Ultra profiles, disabled on Mac Compatible for GPU compatibility.
option.SH_SKYLIGHT_INTENSITY=Intensity
option.SH_SKYLIGHT_INTENSITY.comment=Adjusts the brightness of the soft sky light in shaded areas. Increase to brighten shadows, decrease to deepen them.
option.SH_SKYLIGHT_QUALITY=Quality
option.SH_SKYLIGHT_QUALITY.comment=Controls the quality of the live sky projection. Higher settings use more sky samples for smoother, more accurate skylight at higher GPU cost.

option.RSM_GI=Reflective Shadow Map GI
option.RSM_GI.comment=Enable single-bounce indirect lighting using a Reflective Shadow Map. Gathers bounced light and color from sunlit surfaces near each shaded pixel, using the existing shadow map as the light source. No compute shaders required. Note: Disabled by default on Mac Compatible profile for GPU compatibility.
option.RSM_GI_SAMPLES=RSM Samples
option.RSM_GI_SAMPLES.comment=Number of shadow map taps per pixel when gathering bounced light. Higher = smoother, less noisy GI, lower performance.
option.RSM_GI_RADIUS=RSM Radius
option.RSM_GI_RADIUS.comment=Maximum gather radius, in blocks, for collecting bounced light around each pixel.
option.RSM_GI_INTENSITY=RSM Intensity
option.RSM_GI_INTENSITY.comment=Brightness multiplier for the RSM indirect bounce contribution.

option.FOG_SMOOTHING=Fog Smoothing
option.FOG_SMOOTHING.comment = When enabled, applies an edge-aware Gaussian blur to the fog buffer each frame to reduce blocky/noisy fog artifacts. Current-frame only (no temporal blending), so it won't smear or ghost on fast camera movement. Small performance cost.
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS=Fog Blur Radius
option.FOG_SMOOTHING_RADIUS.comment = Adjusts the radius of the Gaussian blur kernel used for fog smoothing. Higher = softer, more blended fog at higher cost. The blur still respects hard fog-density edges (e.g. cave mouths, fog banks) so it won't bleed across them.

option.CLOUD_LIGHTING_BOUNCES=Cloud Light Bounces
option.CLOUD_LIGHTING_BOUNCES.comment = Adjusts how many times light bounces inside clouds. Higher = more realistic multiple scattering but higher cost. 0 = single scattering only.

option.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING_MODE=Anisotropic Filtering Mode
option.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING_MODE.comment=Anisotropic texture filtering for surface materials. Reduces aliasing and blur on grazing-angle surfaces (ground, walls seen at shallow angles). Off=standard bilinear, 2x/4x/8x/16x=more samples along the major axis of the screen-space footprint.
value.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING_OFF=Off
value.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING_2=2x
value.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING_4=4x
value.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING_8=8x
value.ANISOTROPIC_FILTERING_16=16x

option.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE=Material Mapping Mode
option.MATERIAL_MAPPING_MODE.comment=Controls how PBR material textures (specular/normal maps via labPBR or OldSchoolPBR conventions) are decoded from resource packs. OFF disables, HARDCODED uses built-in per-block values, SPECULAR_ONLY reads just the specular map, NORMALS_ONLY reads just the normal map, SPECULAR_NORMALS reads both.

value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_OFF=Off
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_HARDCODED=Hardcoded Specular
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_SPECULAR_ONLY=Specular Only
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_NORMALS_ONLY=Normals Only
value.MATERIAL_MAPPING_SPECULAR_NORMALS=Specular + Normal Mapping

option.POROSITY=Porosity
option.POROSITY.comment=Enable porosity-based wetness on blocks. Porous blocks (dirt, sand, etc.) darken and become wet when raining.
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH=Porosity Strength
option.POROSITY_STRENGTH.comment=Multiplier for the porosity darkening effect.
option.SSS=Subsurface Scattering
option.SSS.comment=Enable subsurface scattering on organic blocks (leaves, wax, skin). Light enters the surface, scatters inside, and exits at a different point — gives a soft, translucent look.
option.SSS_SHEEN=Subsurface Sheen
option.SSS_SHEEN.comment=Specular "sheen" effect on plants and leaves, helps tall grass and stuff to blend better with the grass specular.
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY=Subsurface Sheen Intensity
option.SSS_SHEEN_INTENSITY.comment=Brightness multiplier for the subsurface sheen effect.


option.TAA_INTENSITY=TAA Strength
option.TAA_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the blend weight of temporal anti-aliasing. Higher = smoother image with less flicker but more ghosting on moving objects.
option.FXAA_INTENSITY=FXAA Strength
option.FXAA_INTENSITY.comment = Adjusts the strength of fast approximate anti-aliasing. Higher = smoother edges but softer image.

option.VOXY_QUALITY=Voxy Quality
option.VOXY_QUALITY.comment = Selects the detail level for Voxy (Distant Horizons LOD) terrain. Higher = more triangles and sharper distant terrain at higher cost.
value.VOXY_QUALITY_OFF=Off
value.VOXY_QUALITY_BASIC=Basic
value.VOXY_QUALITY_STANDARD=Standard
value.VOXY_QUALITY_HIGH=High
option.VOXY_LIGHTING_MODE=Voxy Lighting Mode
option.VOXY_LIGHTING_MODE.comment = Selects how Voxy terrain is lit. Mode 0 = simple, Mode 1 = more accurate shading.
option.VOXY_BRIGHTNESS=Voxy Brightness
option.VOXY_BRIGHTNESS.comment = Adjusts the overall brightness of Voxy distant terrain to better match nearby chunks.
option.VOXY_SHADOWS=Voxy Shadows
option.VOXY_SHADOWS.comment = When enabled, Voxy distant terrain casts and receives shadows like nearby terrain. Moderate performance cost.
option.VOXY_REFLECTIONS=Voxy Reflections
option.VOXY_REFLECTIONS.comment = When enabled, Voxy terrain appears in screen-space reflections. Adds distant reflections on water at higher cost.

option.WATER_WAVES_NOISE_STRENGTH=Water Waves Noise Strength
option.WATER_WAVES_NOISE_STRENGTH.comment = Controls water waves noise strength.
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_MODE=Rain Puddles Mode
option.RAIN_PUDDLES_MODE.comment=Controls when rain puddles appear. OFF disables. RAIN shows puddles only when it's raining. EVERYWHERE shows puddles in any biome (even ones that don't normally get rain).
